# === SESSION FILES (gitignored per CLAUDE.md) ===
# Anchored to repo root (leading /): without it, git matches the basename
# anywhere in the tree, and this repo has core.ignorecase=true, so an
# unrelated file like .claude/commands/handoff.md was silently swallowed by
# the bare "HANDOFF.md" pattern below (found 2026-07-04).
/HANDOFF.md
/CLAUDE.local.md
/for claude
/readandunderstandargus.md
/architecture/

.DS_Store
argus.code-workspace
repositories.code-workspace